OL,3,CFarmers' union calls for Muir to resign
OL,5,FA farmers' union has called on
OL,6,FAgriculture Minister Andrew Muir to
OL,7,Fresign amid ongoing controversy over
OL,8,Fthe shooting of 51 cows in Co Tyrone.
OL,10,FThe Ulster Farmers' Union made the
OL,11,Fcall following an emergency meeting
OL,12,Fwhich concluded members "do not have
OL,13,Fconfidence" in the independence of a
OL,14,Freview into the cattle cull set up by
OL,15,Fthe minister.
OL,17,FA spokesperson for the Department of
OL,18,FAgriculture, Environment and Rural
OL,19,FAffairs said its door "remains open"
OL,20,Ffor engagement with the UFU.
OL,26,@tD@YOUuD@KO]{D@WOU{D@dO]
