OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F416A1786915121
OL,3,CFarmers' union calls for Muir to resign
OL,5,FDaera's Humane Slaughter Team carried
OL,6,Fout the cull of 51 cattle on land near
OL,7,FFivemiletown in June, following a
OL,8,Fcourt order which disqualified the
OL,9,Fherd owner from keeping animals.
OL,11,FConcerns have been raised by some
OL,12,Fpolitical representatives and farmers
OL,13,Fabout the public nature of the
OL,14,Fincident and questions have been posed
OL,15,Fabout whether all options were
OL,16,Fexhausted before the cows were shot.
OL,18,FHundreds of farmers protested outside
OL,19,FStormont on Monday as Mr Muir answered
OL,20,Fquestions about the incident at his
OL,21,Fscrutiny committee.
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G2/9
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
