FL,417,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41603
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F416A1786915121
OL,3,CFarmers' union calls for Muir to resign
OL,5,FAt the meeting, Mr Muir revealed he
OL,6,Fhad received a death threat since the
OL,7,Fincident. He has insisted there was
OL,8,F"no reasonable alternative" but to
OL,9,Fcomply with the court order by culling
OL,10,Fthe animals on the site.
OL,12,FMr Muir announced this week that Dr
OL,13,FMartin Blake, former chief veterinary
OL,14,Fofficer for Ireland, had been
OL,15,Fappointed to carry out an independent
OL,16,Freview into the cull.
OL,18,FLast year, the UFU had passed a vote
OL,19,Fof no confidence in the department
OL,20,Fover its handling of a number of
OL,21,Fissues.
OL,26,@pD@AOUpD@[O]
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G3/9
