CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F416A1786915121
OL,3,CFarmers' union calls for Muir to resign
OL,5,FFollowing its emergency meeting, it
OL,6,Fhas now extended the motion to include
OL,7,FMr Muir, Daera permanent secretary
OL,8,FKatrina Godfrey and chief veterinary
OL,9,Fofficer Brian Dooher, calling for
OL,10,Ftheir immediate resignations.
OL,12,FA statement said: "The decision was
OL,13,Freached during an emergency meeting of
OL,14,Fthe UFU executive, having considered
OL,15,Fthe information currently available.
OL,26,@tD@SOU
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G4/9
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
