FL,417,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41605
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F416A1786915121
OL,3,CFarmers' union calls for Muir to resign
OL,5,F"The UFU has concluded that it does
OL,6,Fnot have the confidence in the
OL,7,Findependence of the review as
OL,8,Fpresently constituted, including the
OL,9,Fscope of the terms of reference and
OL,10,Fappointment of a single person to
OL,11,Fconduct it.
OL,13,F"The UFU has consistently maintained
OL,14,Fthat an investigation into an incident
OL,15,Fof this seriousness must be
OL,16,Fdemonstrably independent, robust and
OL,17,Fcapable of commanding the confidence
OL,18,Fof farm families and the wider public."
OL,26,@mD@AOUuD@AOUzD@gO]
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G5/9
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
