FL,417,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41606
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F416A1786915121
OL,3,CFarmers' union calls for Muir to resign
OL,5,FUFU president John McLenaghan said:
OL,6,F"This is not a decision the UFU has
OL,7,Ftaken lightly.
OL,9,F"However, confidence has been severely
OL,10,Fdamaged and the most recent event is
OL,11,Fjust one of many instances where
OL,12,Ffarmers feel that the department has
OL,13,Flost touch with farmers.
OL,15,F"Serious concerns have been raised
OL,16,Fregarding the independence of the
OL,17,Freview, its terms of reference and
OL,18,Flack of specialist panel appointed.
OL,26,@nD@AOUqD@AOUwD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G6/9
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,417,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41607
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F416A1786915121
OL,3,CFarmers' union calls for Muir to resign
OL,5,F"In the view of our union, the process
OL,6,Fas it currently stands does not
OL,7,Fprovide the level of independence and
OL,8,Fconfidence that farmers deserve.
OL,10,F"Independence cannot just be simply
OL,11,Fstated, it must be evident in how a
OL,12,Freview is established, who conducts
OL,13,Fit, what they are empowered to
OL,14,Finvestigate and whether they are able
OL,15,Fto follow the evidence wherever it
OL,16,Fleads."
OL,18,FMr McLenaghan said: "The UFU's
OL,19,Fposition is clear. We no longer have
OL,20,Fconfidence that the department can
OL,21,Fdeliver.
OL,26,@mD@AOUrD@AOUxD@GO]zD@UOU
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G7/9
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,417,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41608
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F416A1786915121
OL,3,CFarmers' union calls for Muir to resign
OL,5,F"The UFU will continue to press for an
OL,6,Findependent, transparent, and public
OL,7,Freview of the Fivemiletown operation."
OL,9,FA Daera spokesperson said: "The
OL,10,Fminister and the department are aware
OL,11,Fof the decision taken by the Ulster
OL,12,FFarmers' Union.
OL,14,F"An external independent review is
OL,15,Falready under way to review the action
OL,16,Ftaken by department officials in
OL,17,Fresponse to the Deprivation Order in
OL,18,FFivemiletown.
OL,26,@mD@AOUoD@fO]qD@\OUvD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G8/9
