PN,41609
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F416A1786915121
OL,3,CFarmers' union calls for Muir to resign
OL,5,F"There are many strategic issues and
OL,6,Fchallenges for agriculture. It is
OL,7,Fvital we face up to those challenges
OL,8,Ftogether to restore our environment
OL,9,Fand ensure a sustainable future for
OL,10,Fagriculture.
OL,12,F"The department's door will remain
OL,13,Fopen to engage with all including the
OL,14,FUFU."
